# FISH_MARKET Monorepo Environment Variables

This project uses Turborepo with separate environment files for each app.

## Backend 
Create your backend environment file here:
`apps/backend/.env`
(Copy from `apps/backend/.env.example`)

## Frontend
Create your frontend environment file here:
`apps/frontend/.env.local`
(Copy from `apps/frontend/.env.example`)

> Do NOT place `.env` files in this root directory. 
> Turborepo caching relies on app-specific environment configurations.
